(c3) TAn[so great](d')tum(e) er[therefore a sacrament](f')go(f) Sa(f')cra(e)mén(gh)tum(fefvED.) (,)
Ve[let us adore](d')ne(e)ré(f')mur(e) cér[bowing](d')nu(e)i :(d.) (;)
Et[and ancient covenant](d) an(f')tí(h)quum(h') do(i)cu(g')mén(h)tum(h.) (,)
No[shall yield to the](h')vo(i) ce(k')dat(j) rí(i')tu[new rite](k)i :(jvIH'ih.0) (:)
Prae[faith may provide supplement](d')stet(e) fi(f')des(f) sup(f')ple(e)mén(gh)tum(fefvED.) (,)
Sén[for senses' deficiency](d')su(e)um(f') de(e)fé(d')ctu(e)i.(d.) (::) 
2. Ge[ to Father](d')ni(e)tó(f')ri,(f) Ge[& to Son](f')ni(e)tó(gh)que(fefvED.) (,)
Laus[Praise and ](d') et(e) ju[jubilation](f')bi(e)lá(d')ti(e)o,(d.) (;)
Sa[salvation, honour, power also](d)lus,(f') ho(h)nor,(h') vir(i)tus(g') quo(h)que(h.) (,)
Sit[be](h') et[& blessing](i) be(k')ne(j)dí(i')cti(k)o :(jvIH'ih.0) (:)
Pro[proceeding](d')ce(e)dén(f')ti(f) ab[from both](f') u(e)tró(gh)que(fefvED.) (,)
Com[equal](d')par(e) sit[be](f') lau[praising](e)dá(d')ti(e)o.(d.) (::) 
